          "email": "adilger@thelustrecollective.com",
          "date": "2026-07-22 07:50:02.000000000",
          "tz": -360
        },
        "subject": "LU-20435 tests: skip sanity/430a for older clients",
        "message": "LU-20435 tests: skip sanity/430a for older clients\n\nThe sanity.sh test_430a behavior was modified to avoid ZFS blocksize\nexpansion during testing now that the DMU SEEK_HOLE/SEEK_DATA feature\nis working properly.  However, older clients can detect the new server\nhas seek_hole support and will run the old version of this test, which\nfails because ZFS blocksize expansion confuses the test, not because\nZFS seek support is broken.\n\nSkip test_430a for older clients without the modified seek hole test.\nThis will skip both ldiskfs and ZFS OSTs, but only for a short window.\nThe current remote exception mechanism doesn't allow checking FSTYPE.\n\nMerge sanity.56aa.ex into sanity.ex now the merge conflict is gone.\nThis reduces the number of files that need to be processed each time.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nTest-Parameters: testlist=sanity clientversion=2.17 env=ONLY=56+430,HONOR_EXCEPT=y\nFixes: 2868627130 (\"LU-20435 build: fix dmu_offset_next() check\")\nFixes: 84242c4358 (\"LU-20010 tests: fix and rename sanity/56aa\")\nSigned-off-by: Andreas Dilger <adilger@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: Iae0da5856e76e275059dba13f87d1b82b53ebbe5\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
  },
